# Installation MCP tools.
#
# Each `*.mjs` / `*.js` module here exports `tools` (named export,
# `default.tools`, or the default export): an array of entries shaped like the
# kernel tools in agent/tools-mcp/index.mjs —
#   { name, description, schema /* JSON Schema */, run: async (args) => string }
# — or a function `({ run, exec, BIN, ws })` returning one. Optional `after`:
# the name of a tool the module's tools follow in the served list (keeps the
# list, part of every session's cached prompt prefix, in a stable order).
# Loaded once at server start and served as `mcp__tools__<name>`; a name a
# kernel tool already has is ignored, a module that fails to import is skipped
# with a log line.
#
# Not the same as agent/ext/ (agent-authored modules approved through the
# self-improvement gate): `_ext/` is code you wrote.
#
# Everything here except this file is gitignored — see .gitignore and
# docs/architecture-public-private.md.
